<%- | 
  String $title,
  Optional[String] $description,
  String $sponsor,
  Integer $quota_gib,
  Integer $quota_bytes,
  Optional[String] $effective_read_group,
  Array[String] $extra_read_groups,
  Array[String] $writers
| -%>
# <%= $title %>

## Purpose
<%= $description ? {
  undef   => 'No description provided.',
  default => $description
} %>

## Sponsor (owner)

<%= $sponsor %>

## Quota

<%= $quota_gib %> GiB (<%= $quota_bytes %> bytes)

## Read access

Primary read group:
<%= $effective_read_group ? {
  undef   => '(none)',
  default => $effective_read_group
} %>

Extra read groups:
<%= $extra_read_groups.empty ? {
  true  => '(none)',
  false => join($extra_read_groups, ', ')
} %>

## Write access (ACL)

<%= $writers.empty ? {
  true  => '(none)',
  false => join($writers, ', ')
} %>

---

This directory is managed by Puppet.

ACLs are enforced using `posix_acl`, and default ACLs ensure new files
inherit the correct permissions.
